From a04ed82a8cef9f063b627704e16c46ea08e86186 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 03:59:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix stock detail 500 on sqlite and backtest returning
 zero trades
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- app.py stock_detail: sqlite3.Row has no .get(); convert latest row to a
  dict so the page renders on both SQLite and Postgres
- features.py run_backtest: the pick quality gate was still score < 60 —
  with the ~30-pt achievable max it skipped every pick, so backtests
  reported no trades; lower to < 10 and use row indexing instead of .get()
---
 app.py      | 2 +-
 features.py | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

